# Allowlist: track only the hand-written config, ignore everything else.
# pi writes logins (auth.json), tokens (models-store.json), trust.json, sessions/,
# npm/ and git/ into this folder. When ~/.pi did not exist before `stow .`, stow
# links the whole ~/.pi folder into this repo, so those land here. Anything not
# named below stays ignored, including files a future pi version adds.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!settings.json
!models.json
!prompts/
!prompts/*.md
!extensions/
!extensions/metrics/
!extensions/metrics/*.ts
